504","id":3061317562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62d_-6","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T08:52:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T08:52:51Z","body":"The compiler isn't allowed to make this kind of optimization. It's a good idea to test in release mode but i don't expect this to perform worse there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061317562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061320291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504#issuecomment-3061320291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108504","id":3061320291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc62eApj","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-11T08:53:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-11T08:53:46Z","body":"> Did you benchmark in release mode? The temporary struct copying here might be optimized and the overhead shouldn't be so noticeable if compiler is smart enough.\r\n\r\nGood catch, I forgot that I hadn't switched my compiler settings back over. Using optimize=speed_trace:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmaster\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1320.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1230.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1231.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1216.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1229.0}\r\n\r\noptimize-duplicate\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1234.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1138.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1146.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1161.0}\r\n  Result: {\"time\":1152.0}\r\n ```\r\n \r\n I just ran these back to back in one run each, so the slow first one is probably some sort of cache warmup. Seems like a similar level of speed up.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3061320291/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308799756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108504#issuecomment-3308799756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108504","id":3308799756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FOEcM","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T17:51:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T17:51:14Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308799756/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]